        <li class="ai-lab__item"><h3 data-i18n-html="hm-ailab-1">AI 가상미래연구소</h3></li>
        <li class="ai-lab__item"><h3 data-i18n-html="hm-ailab-2">AI 가상경영연구소</h3></li>
        <li class="ai-lab__item"><h3 data-i18n-html="hm-ailab-3">AI 가상경제연구소</h3></li>
        <li class="ai-lab__item"><h3 data-i18n-html="hm-ailab-4">AI 가상금융투자연구소</h3></li>
      </ul>
